> vecnu ti mi" mean the same thing?
>
> I know that cu means that a selbri is coming up and separates that from
> the sumti (that could turn into tanru without cu separating it) And that
> lo turns a selbri into a sumti and ko finishes the conversion.  .uanaiI'm learning from wave lessons now instead of Lojban for beginners and they
